hool @ USTC\">Chinese Language and Summer School @ USTC</a><small class=\"startdate\">Starting Date:</small></li><li><i class=\"icon-angle-right\"></i> <a href=\"https://ustc.admissions.cn/course/view/22701-Short Term Visiting Student\">Short Term Visiting Student</a><small class=\"startdate\">Starting Date:</small></li><li><i class=\"icon-angle-right\"></i> <a href=\"https://ustc.admissions.cn/course/view/22702-USTC Future Scientist Summer Camp\">USTC Future Scientist Summer Camp</a><small class=\"startdate\">Starting Date:</small></li>            </ul>\n            <div class=\"text-center\">\n            <a href=\"/course/degree/Non-degree\" class=\"btn btn-default btn-block btn-mini\">Show More Non-degree (4)</a></div>\n          </div>\n          </div><div class=\"pricing-stack\">\n          <div class=\"block well\">\n            <h4 class=\"title-divider\"><span>Bachelor-Program<span class=\"de-em\"> | 34 programs for admissions</span></span></h4>\n            <ul class=\"big-list tags\">\n                            <li><i class=\"icon-angle-right\"></i> <a href=\"https://ustc.admissions.cn/course/view/20683-Biological Science\">Biological Science</a><small class=\"startdate\">Starting Date:September</small></li><li><i class=\"icon-angle-right\"></i> <a href=\"https://ustc.admissions.cn/course/view/20684-Biological Technology\">Biological Technology</a><small class=\"startdate\">Starting Date:September</small></li><li><i class=\"icon-angle-right\"></i> <a href=\"https://ustc.admissions.cn/course/view/20685-Theoretical and Applied Mechanics\">Theoretical and Applied Mechanics</a><small class=\"startdate\">Starting Date:September</small></li><li><i class=\"icon-angle-right\"></i> <a href=\"https://ustc.admissions.cn/course/view/20686-Mechanical Design, Manufacture and Automation\">Mechanical Design, Manufacture and Automation</a><small class=\"startdate\">Starting Date:September</small></li><li><i class=\"icon-angle-right\"></i> <a href=\"https://ustc.admissions.cn/course/view/20687-Measurement and Control Technology and Instrument\">Measurement and Control Technology and Instrument</a><small class=\"startdate\">Starting Date:September</small></li>            </ul>\n            <div class=\"text-center\">\n            <a href=\"/course/degree/Bachelor-Program\" class=\"btn btn-default btn-block btn-mini\">Show More Bachelor-Program (34)</a></div>\n          </div>\n          </div><div class=\"pricing-stack\">\n          <div class=\"block well\">\n            <h4 class=\"title-divider\"><span>Master-Program<span class=\"de-em\"> | 155 programs for admissions</span></span></h4>\n            <ul class=\"big-list tags\">\n                            <li><i class=\"icon-angle-right\"></i> <a href=\"https://ustc.admissions.cn/course/view/20708-Analytical Chemistry\">Analytical Chemistry</a><small class=\"startdate\">Starting Date:September</small></li><li><i class=\"icon-angle-right\"></i> <a href=\"https://ustc.admissions.cn/course/view/20709-Applied Chemistry\">Applied Chemistry</a><small class=\"startdate\">Starting Date:September</small></li><li><i class=\"icon-angle-right\"></i> <a href=\"https://ustc.admissions.cn/course/view/20710-Biomass Chemistry\">Biomass Chemistry</a><small class=\"startdate\">Starting Date:September</small></li><li><i class=\"icon-angle-right\"></i> <a href=\"https://ustc.admissions.cn/course/view/20711-Chemical Biology\">Chemical Biology</a><small class=\"startdate\">Starting Date:September</small></li><li><i class=\"icon-angle-right\"></i> <a href=\"https://ustc.admissions.cn/course/view/20712-Chemistry\">Chemistry</a><small class=\"startdate\">Starting Date:September</small></li>            </ul>\n            <div class=\"text-center\">\n            <a href=\"/course/degree/Master-Program\" class=\"btn btn-default btn-block btn-mini\">Show More Master-Program (155)</a></div>\n          </div>\n          </div><div class=\"pricing-stack\">\n          <div class=\"block well\">\n            <h4 class=\"title-divider\"><span>Doctor-Program<span class=\"de-em\"> | 94 programs for admissions</span></span></h4>\n            <ul class=\"big-list tags\">\n                            <li><i class=\"icon-angle-right\"></i> <a href=\"https://ustc.admissions.cn/course/view/22890-Thermal Power Engineering\n\">Thermal Power Engineering\n</a><small class=\"startdate\">Starting Date:September</small></li><li><i class=\"icon-angle-right\"></i> <a href=\"https://ustc.admissions.cn/course/view/22889-Theoretical Physics\">Theoretical Physics</a><small class=\"startdate\">Starting Date:September</small></li><li><i class=\"icon-angle-right\"></i> <a href=\"https://ustc.admissions.cn/course/view/22888-Testing Technology and Automation Devices\">Testing Technology and Automation Devices</a><small class=\"startdate\">Starting Date:September</small></li><li><i class=\"icon-angle-right\"></i> <a href=\"https://ustc.admissions.cn/course/view/22887-Tectonics Geology\">Tectonics Geology</a><small class=\"startdate\">Starting Date:September</small></li><li><i class=\"icon-angle-right\"></i> <a href=\"https://ustc.admissions.cn/course/view/22885-Systems Engineering\">Systems Engineering</a><small class=\"startdate\">Starting Date:September</small></li>            </ul>\n            <div class=\"text-center\">\n            <a href=\"/course/degree/Doctor-Program\" class=\"btn btn-default btn-block btn-mini\">Show More Doctor-Program (94)</a></div>\n          </div>\n          </div>        </div>\n        \n        <!--Contact block-->\n        <div class=\"span4\">\n          <h3 class=\"title-divider\"><span>Profile</span> <!-- <small>About Our University!</small> --></h3>\n\n          <div class=\" pricing-stack\">\r\n  \r\n    <div class=\"well\">\r\n      <ul class=\"unstyled points\">\r\n        <!-- <li>University of Science and Technology of China</li> -->\r\n        <li>Founded in: <small class=\"unstyled-color\"> 1958</small></li>\r\n        <li>Campus: <small class=\"unstyled-color\"> 5 campuses + 1 more under construction</small></li>\r\n        <li>Students: <small class=\"unstyled-color\"> 25070 (as of 2020-12)</small></li>\r\n        <li>Int'l Students: <small class=\"unstyled-color\"> 665 (as of 2020 -12)</small></li>\r\n        <li>Scholarship: <small class=\"unstyled-color\"> Yes</small></li>admissions\r\n        <!-- <li>Average Tuition Fee:<small class=\"unstyled-color\">  RMB</small></li> -->\r\n      </ul>\r\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://ustc.applyonline.cn\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">ustc.applyonline.cn<i class=\"btn-admissions\"></i></a>\r\n      <!-- <a class=\"btn\" href=\"javascript:favorite(1866,2)\"><i class=\"icon-star\"></i> Add to My Favorites</a> -->\r\n    </div>\r\n  \r\n</div>\n          <div class=\"pricing-stack\">\n            <div class=\"well\">\n                <p>Dear applicants:</p>\n                <p>Please download WeChat app and scan QR code below, to start your application journey.</p>\n                <p align=\"center\"><img src=\"/resources/qcode/ustc.jpg\" onerror=\"javascript:this.src='/resources/image005.jpg';\" width=\"240\"></p>\n                <p align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://www.wechat.com/en\" target=\"_blank\">We prefer to communicate with you via WeChat \u23ec</a></p>\n            </div>\n              \n          </div>\n          <!-- <div class=\" pricing-stack\">\n              <div class=\"well\"><a href=\"http://www.studyinchina.help\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/resources/school/default/img/help.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n\n              </div><img style=\"float:left;\" src=\"/resources/20180614103101.jpg\" alt=\"\" title=\"\">\n          </div> -->\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- Services -->\n    <div class=\"block features\">\n      <h2 class=\"title-divider\"><span>Express Lane <span class=\"de-em\">Application</span></span> <small>Core features included in all plans.</small></h2>\n      <ul class=\"thumbnails\">\n        <li class=\"span3\"> <a href=\"/guide\"><img src=\"/resources/school/default/img/features/feature-1.png\" alt=\"Feature 1\" /></a>\n          <h3 class=\"title\"><a href=\"/guide\">Guide <span class=\"de-em\">Application requirement</span></a></h3>\n          <p>Guide you how to apply for Study in University of Science and Technology of China.</p>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"span3\"> <a href=\"/album\"><img src=\"/resources/school/default/img/features/feature-2.png\" alt=\"Feature 2\" /></a>\n          <h3 class=\"title\"><a href=\"/album\">Album <span class=\"de-em\">Gallary</span></a></h3>\n          <p>Share universities\u2019 photos and students\u2019 activities with you.</p>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"span3\"> <a href=\"/video\"><img src=\"/resources/school/default/img/features/feature-3.png\" alt=\"Feature 3\" /></a>\n          <h3 class=\"title\"><a href=\"/video\">Video</a></h3>\n          <p>Expose yourself to vivid campus and student fellows.</p>\n        </li>\n        <!-- <li class=\"span3\"> <a href=\"/downloads\"><img src=\"/resources/school/default/img/features/feature-4.png\" alt=\"Feature 4\" /></a>\n          <h3 class=\"title\"><a href=\"/downloads\">Download <span class=\"de-em\">Application File</span></a></h3>\n          <p>Help yourself download the application form and other relevant documents.</p>\n        </li> -->\n        <li class=\"span3\"> <a href=\"/schoolScholarship\"><img src=\"/resources/school/default/img/features/image016.png\" alt=\"Feature 4\" /></a>\n          <h3 class=\"title\"><a href=\"/schoolScholarship\">Schoarship</a></h3>\n          <p>Generous/good scholarships are waiting for you, not to be missed.</p>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"block\">\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"span8\">\n          <div class=\"tabbable\">\n            <ul class=\"nav nav-tabs\" id=\"myTab\">\n              <li class=\"active\"><a data-toggle=\"tab\" href=\"#tab-1\" class=\"de-em renmenfonts\">News</a></li>\n              <li class=\"\"><a data-toggle=\"tab\" href=\"#tab-2\" class=\"renmenfonts\">Notice</a></li>\n              <li class=\"tabmore\"><span><a href=\"#\">More +</a></span></li>\n            </ul>\n            <div class=\"tab-content\" id=\"myTabContent\">\n              <div id=\"tab-1\" class=\"tab-pane clearfix active\">\n                <ul class=\"New-ulwidth clearfix\">\n                  <li>\n                    <h4 class=\"title media-heading\"><a href=\"info/University of Science and Technology of China\">About University of Science and Technology of China</a></h4>\n                    <p>University of Science and Technology of China \uff08USTC\uff09 is under the jurisdiction of the Chinese Academy of Sciences \uff08CAS\uff09. It was established in Beijing in 1958, and moved to Hefei in 1970. It has been one of the first institutions included in China's &quot;985 Program&quot; and &quot;Project 211&quot;, and the only university participating in the National Program for Knowledge Innovation. USTC has 20 schools, 30 departments, 8 national key programs of first-level disciplines. USTC has 1916 faculty members, of whom 49 are academicians of CAS or Chinese Academy of Engineering, 17 academicians of the The World Academy of Sciences, 613 professors and 699 associate professors. Of its 25000 plus students, over 5071 are doctoral students, over 11944 are masters students, and more than 7370 are undergraduate students. From 2000, USTC had joined Chinese Government Scholarship Programs \uff08CGSP\uff09. Now there\u2019re 665 international students from 59 countries. </p>\n                  </li>\n                  \n                </ul>\n              </div>\n              <div id=\"tab-2\" class=\"tab-pane\">\n                <ul>\n                  <li>\n                    <h4 class=\"title media-heading\"><a href=\"info/University of Science and Technology of China\">About University of Science and Technology of China</a></h4>\n                    <p>University of Science and Technology of China \uff08USTC\uff09 is under the jurisdiction of the Chinese Academy of Sciences \uff08CAS\uff09. It was established in Beijing in 1958, and moved to Hefei in 1970. It has been one of the first institutions included in China's &quot;985 Program&quot; and &quot;Project 211&quot;, and the only university participating in the National Program for Knowledge Innovation. USTC has 20 schools, 30 departments, 8 national key programs of first-level disciplines. USTC has 1916 faculty members, of whom 49 are academicians of CAS or Chinese Academy of Engineering, 17 academicians of the The World Academy of Sciences, 613 professors and 699 associate professors. Of its 25000 plus students, over 5071 are doctoral students, over 11944 are masters students, and more than 7370 are undergraduate students. From 2000, USTC had joined Chinese Government Scholarship Programs \uff08CGSP\uff09. Now there\u2019re 665 international students from 59 countries. </p>\n                  </li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"span4\">\n          <h3 class=\"\"><span class=\"de-em\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Admissions Ambassador</span></h3>\n          <div class=\"\"><span href=\"\" id=\"\"><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/f9nSeUbJ8sitHntPjOgprw\" target=\"_blank\"><img style=\"padding-left:10px; float:left;\" src=\"/resources/school/default/img/1000.jpg\" alt=\"\" title=\"\"></a></span>\n          </div>\n          <!-- <div class=\"\"> <span href=\"\" id=\"myQues\"><img style=\"float:right;\" src=\"/resources/school/default/img/scImg/scImg2.jpg\" alt=\"\" title=\"\"></span>\n          </div> -->\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div> \n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<!-- FOOTER -->\n<div id=\"content-below\" class=\"wrapper\">\r\n  <div class=\"container\">\r\n    <div class=\"row-fluid\">\r\n      <div class=\"upsell\"> <small class=\"m